{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣藝人NONO（陳宣裕）被士檢依7次性侵、猥褻等罪起訴，一審由士林地院審理後，認定NONO曾企圖對一名女子強行發生性行為，但因對方奮力反抗未能得逞，因此依強制性交未遂罪判處2年6個月徒刑，不過，其餘6項被控罪名，法院認為檢方提出的證據不足</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:43:54.853678+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:22:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:14.287303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:14.287303+00:00","content_hash":"049147e0bbef684006bdd1fc518f9d9f6d9d18c9e20d2870018d642d15cd33d2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}